@id=free-vocabulary @kind=decision
Feature: Kinds and relations are the authors' words

  Not a metamodel, which makes every team translate its words into ours: sdp reads meaning into a
  few words only, and a workspace renames those; it cannot remove one, which would switch off what
  sdp reads through it without a word. The price is that a misspelt kind or relation is a new word,
  not an error: only a question that asks for the right one is told the closest word in use.
